WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.860
A Greek king called Milinda meets
a Buddhist monk called Nagasena.

2
00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:07.840
The monk says that his
name is only a name,

3
00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:09.330
a way of speaking.

4
00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:12.130
No permanent individual is found here.

5
00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:13.930
The king is astonished.

6
00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:15.710
Then who keeps the precepts?

7
00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:17.230
Who meditates?

8
00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:19.860
So the monk asks the king how he came.

9
00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:21.720
By chariot, of course.

10
00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:27.180
If a chariot is only its parts, is there
anyone inside you doing the steering?

11
00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:30.820
In this mission, you'll take a
person apart into five heaps,

12
00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:32.420
from body to consciousness.

13
00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:35.750
Then you'll take the chariot
apart, piece by piece,

14
00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:36.930
with the monk.

15
00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:40.730
Your mission: find out what
the Buddha meant by not-self,

16
00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:42.450
and whether anyone is steering.
